{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_065_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_065_title", "source_sha256": "d06d520bebf75099feb413e1ec75149603ca6dc96d1636208fc2f28b18c87d72", "ja": "この、てのひらのなか", "zh": "在这掌心之中", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_065_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_065_synopsis", "source_sha256": "f3e5e6e703b616034fd8d7e9db0802ed9bb3b3060eb41b009c357326373d3785", "ja": "恋を意識しろと周囲に焚き付けられた結果、\n必要以上にプロデューサーを意識してしまう\n百合子。だが、恋に戸惑う気持ちは最初から\n自分の中にあったものだと気づき、新曲への\n思いを新たにする。", "zh": "在周围人的起哄与鼓动下，百合子不得不\n去在意恋情，结果反而过分在意起了制作人。\n但她察觉到，对恋爱感到困惑的心情其实打从\n一开始就在自己心中，从而坚定了面对新歌的心意。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_065_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_065_1000_p", "source_sha256": "f487ce2f3555538e137dd4ae63af72a9b8bdc5d675c2ed7e4b83327e5c476d11", "ja": "（百合子の新しい曲のお披露目が終わった。\n客席からは、拍手と歓声……やったな、百合子！）", "zh": "（百合子的新歌首演结束了。观众席传来掌声和欢呼……干得漂亮，百合子！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_065_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_065_1001_026yur", "source_sha256": "f8c9e14bc49f84a70964265a2123ed016afc8386aa469d8ffdf67e28e74cd260", "ja": "{$P$}さん、お疲れさまです！\nあのっ、どうでしたか！？", "zh": "{$P$}先生，辛苦了！\n那个，表现得怎么样！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_065_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_065_1002_p", "source_sha256": "a4dbfe30adf24df10461053649d0430c171ac990c1c605a0ced57b2643aff965", "ja": "ああ、いいステージだったよ！\n頑張った甲斐があったな、百合子。", "zh": "啊，真是一场精彩的演出！\n努力没有白费呢，百合子。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_065_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_065_1003_026yur", "source_sha256": "0305414a88603661628f7ac3f4522e2e9e7953313270ddb9f98032e72beaa62f", "ja": "本当ですか？　よかったぁ……。", "zh": "真的吗？太好了……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_065_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_065_1004_009rit", "source_sha256": "a34be86e96dfef0ff9c1ddfeee8cd18e911ed263a20b22f62f194ca6387a58aa", "ja": "すごいじゃない、百合子！　歌とダンスは\nもちろん、表現力もかなり上がったんじゃない？", "zh": "很厉害嘛，百合子！歌唱和舞蹈自不用说，表现力也提升了不少吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_065_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_065_1005_020meg", "source_sha256": "9fdf42c3d128180db57b9e2e34b5f4f70bb457e2f749faecdb52c5d8e2659a75", "ja": "うんうん！　アタシも、ちょっとドキッとしちゃった。\nねえねえ、どんなコト考えて歌ってたの？", "zh": "嗯嗯！我也有点心动了呢。\n说说看，你唱歌时都在想些什么？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_065_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_065_1006_045kar", "source_sha256": "102e3b7669bd4bf58841bc0efd4bd366c3cebdfbc83c3a7bceda686ea23e9b1a", "ja": "わ、私も……ちょっと、気になるかも……。\n百合子ちゃん、どうだった……？", "zh": "我、我也……好像有点在意……  \n百合子，你觉得怎么样……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_065_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_065_1007_026yur", "source_sha256": "e024325ad2a65ed922ff86bfc091b4c3cf2cd827fb871574330c38f318d857a3", "ja": "ええっ！？\nえっと、それはその……ですね……。", "zh": "诶！？\n那个，这个嘛……该怎么说呢……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_065_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_065_1008_021mat", "source_sha256": "37938425fac6c0f429dcbecee2da6fdc53501cf9c3412afc7615af86b3a9ea29", "ja": "むむっ。百合子ちゃん、なんだか怪しいのです。\n隠しごとなんかしないで、素直に白状するのです～。", "zh": "唔唔。百合子，感觉很可疑呢。\n不要有所隐瞒，老老实实招供吧～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_065_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_065_1009_026yur", "source_sha256": "e5bf7ed43a3d84aab3e789e63196ae044f3fc0fc4ea56031bf639f94c8044823", "ja": "か、隠しごとをしているわけではなくて……\nああっ、まつりさん、やめてください～！", "zh": "我、我不是在隐瞒什么，只是……\n啊啊，茉莉小姐，请住手——！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_065_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_065_1010_p", "source_sha256": "3e8f8fa303738c5dce6bae88ec16f60bc59ab4002fdb9a94143179d1a4e3529b", "ja": "まあまあ……それより、風邪をひくといけないから、\n先に着替えてきた方がいいんじゃないか？", "zh": "好了好了……比起这个，要是感冒了可不好，\n还是先去把衣服换了吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_065_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_065_1011_020meg", "source_sha256": "d45714c0a245ab0b829469bc6bd5b45ced02825d0de02b8113fffec017651cb9", "ja": "あっ、それもそうだね！　そんじゃ、\n着替えながら聞いちゃおっかな！　にゃははっ♪", "zh": "啊，这么说也对！那我就边换衣服边听吧！呀哈哈♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_065_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_065_1012_021mat", "source_sha256": "94b214d3886eb2dc073b36df3c9fe0c2018e8769929135c029a956416c27159d", "ja": "百合子ちゃんも、行くのです♪", "zh": "百合子也要一起去哦♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_065_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_065_1013_026yur", "source_sha256": "187f0b82b495dcff466f77c1eef10458ac050f8956b136008d326904b71c3ac3", "ja": "あ……あの、先に行っててください！\n私、{$P$}さんにお話が……。", "zh": "啊……那个，请先过去吧！\n我有些话想对{$P$}先生说……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_065_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_065_1014_020meg", "source_sha256": "5be658dc5337e629dee59a7993192e16f9f034b3af830da9dbda7168523ea8a9", "ja": "オッケー！\nんじゃ、先に行って待ってるね～。", "zh": "好——！\n那我先过去等你哦～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_065_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_065_1015_p", "source_sha256": "72c96453131eb7e9a7ccec70cbea2fae5518975b838d775e47855b15be1fc536", "ja": "百合子、どうかしたのか？", "zh": "百合子，怎么了？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_065_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_065_1016_026yur", "source_sha256": "2d3067d320addab45c5ada3bd491afea1cba6908478de5943484e7ab1316efb8", "ja": "あの……今回は、ありがとうございました！　この曲が\n歌えたのは、みんなのおかげでもありますけど……。", "zh": "那个……这次真的很感谢您！虽然能唱这首歌，\n也多亏了大家……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_065_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_065_1017_026yur", "source_sha256": "ff5299b0dd055aee3e7ec3bb09e261452b4d4b528875a8636dcbd5aca9252593", "ja": "何より{$P$}さんが、\n立ち止まりそうな私の背中を押してくれたからです。", "zh": "最重要的是，{$P$}先生推了差点停下脚步的我一把。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_065_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_065_1018_026yur", "source_sha256": "ede55d8558589c93055358e1e21083ea9598c18f6cbac92d2460c293e5cd3b44", "ja": "私、この先もまた、立ち止まるかもしれません……でも\nその時は、今日のことを思い出してがんばりますね！", "zh": "我，今后也许还会再次停下脚步……但是，\n到那时，我会想起今天的事，继续努力的！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_065_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_065_1019_p", "source_sha256": "e9c1f858a95c7662f119d768e9b0b5c1ed7bbd40ea8af4ee3d36853d49d0c5f9", "ja": "そう言ってくれるのは光栄だけど、\nその必要はないんじゃないか？", "zh": "你能这么说，我很荣幸，不过，应该没那个必要吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_065_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_065_1020_026yur", "source_sha256": "708104a58be95fa5c338d09ab28d017b2e85ff0847cd8cacda139f9703c50e85", "ja": "えっ？　ど、どうしてですか？", "zh": "诶？为、为什么啊？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_065_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_065_1021_p", "source_sha256": "ae8f6d30cb49ead3d5ded3098cce4b830a048682af150bd42af0d315dbc3c42f", "ja": "だってアイドルとプロデューサーは二人三脚だからな。\n俺はいつでも百合子の後ろにいるし、背中を押すよ。", "zh": "因为偶像和制作人就是同心协力的搭档嘛。\n我一直都会在百合子身后，推你一把。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_065_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_065_1022_026yur", "source_sha256": "304308f930c1093702ffaf143b3003594e810c41ccd857938afbc56c26bad294", "ja": "！　{$P$}さん……もう！\nそ、それ以上近づかないでください！", "zh": "！　{$P$}先生……真是的！\n请、请不要再靠近了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_065_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_065_1023_p", "source_sha256": "3e30faa80de01e9852eb3ab74c01218d43a418628c8b693aac39ccead8429b15", "ja": "ええっ！？", "zh": "咦咦！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_065_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_065_1024_026yur", "source_sha256": "61750f0ba2ae7407a293e579ff4242ceec7d0120519b615e775ded8afba80b03", "ja": "だから、軽率にそういうワードを使うのは、\n禁じ手なんですってば！　もう～！！", "zh": "所以说，随随便便使用那种词，是犯规的啦！真是的～！！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_065_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_065_1025_p", "source_sha256": "e148e776f0c283c1125ca30a6d4398621c4f0ce3cb34e6fae7007ef58053f140", "ja": "そ、そうか。ごめんな……？", "zh": "这、这样啊。对不起……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_065_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_065_1026_p", "source_sha256": "954fb383b99bfea47fc71e4f85c826e4334e9152d4a59fe1f72060c2cc211a54", "ja": "（今日のステージを成功させた事で、アイドル\n七尾百合子の物語に、新しいエピソードが綴られた）", "zh": "（随着今天舞台的成功，偶像七尾百合子的故事又写下了新的篇章。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_065_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_065_1027_p", "source_sha256": "071cb05b3d4b0bc221df73d0d6138e46810e9dc43411d445943c2eb21a432964", "ja": "（そのページは、これからも増え続けていく。百合子が\nどんな超大作を作り上げるのか……楽しみだな！）", "zh": "（那一页今后也会不断增加。真期待百合子\n究竟会创作出怎样的鸿篇巨制啊……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
